msgstr "https://github.com/djm56/msc-post-expiry"

#. Description of the plugin
#: msc-post-expiry.php
msgid ""
"Automatically expire posts and pages on a scheduled date. Set expiration "
"dates in the post editor and let the plugin handle the rest."
msgstr ""
"Secara otomatis kedaluwarsa pos dan halaman pada tanggal yang dijadwalkan. "
"Atur tanggal kedaluwarsa di editor pos dan biarkan plugin menangani sisanya."

