msgstr "Aturan dihapus."

#: includes/class-mscpe-settings.php:884
msgid ""
"Smart Rules automatically determine what happens when a post expires based "
"on its properties — like category, tag, author, age, or custom fields. When "
"a post expires, the plugin checks these rules in priority order. If a rule "
"matches, its action overrides the default expiry action."
msgstr ""
"Aturan Cerdas secara otomatis menentukan apa yang terjadi ketika pos "
"kedaluwarsa berdasarkan propertinya — seperti kategori, tag, penulis, umur, "
"atau field kustom. Ketika pos kedaluwarsa, plugin memeriksa aturan ini dalam"
" urutan prioritas. Jika suatu aturan cocok, tindakannya mengabaikan tindakan"
" kedaluwarsa default."

